		(property "Sourcing_Note" "V_IH is specified as 3.4V absolute at VDD=5.0V, NOT as a ratio of VDD. The Vdrive diode-drop scheme assumes it scales at 0.7xVDD (3.4/5.0 = 0.68, and V_IL 1.8/5.0 = 0.36, so it almost certainly does) - but Inolux does not state this. Confirm with the manufacturer before committing, because 3.3V logic cannot meet a fixed 3.4V threshold at any supply. Also note the 3.5V minimum supply: same headroom problem as the WS2812B-2020 it replaces."
			(at 132.08 34.29 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
